  "releaseNotes": "- Improved prioritizing assembly paths in AssemblyResolver. Includes fix for the recurring bug where Microsoft / ASP.NET assemblies fail to load.\n- Project assembly paths are now prioritized, which should for example eliminate the need to delete old .NET target directories in bin/.\n- Errors and warnings are now logged to stderr.\n- Inner exceptions are now logged.\n- Fixed ConfigProvider.GetDefaultAssemblyPath() throwing CoreException instead of CliException.\n- A failure to resolve an assembly in AssemblyResolver is now logged as a warning instead of an error, since generation might be successful even if some of the dependencies are not found.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "8.1.0",
